
# InLine Pro — Line Monitoring System
## Technical Documentation & Code Execution Manual

**Version:** Phase 1–4 (Engine, Database, API, Web UI)
**Stack:** Python, FastAPI, SQLAlchemy (SQLite dev / SQL Server 2014 production), Jinja2, HTML/CSS (no JavaScript)

